Z||000000||FIERO1985||03-05-2001||05:10 PM||||How much more difficult is it to change plugs on a v8 compared to a 6 and is it the same process (take decklid off or is it easier to reach from underneath!)<P>Thanks<BR>Dan<BR><P>------------------<BR>1985 GT V6 <BR>"LETS RACE"||||reg||1
Z||000001||Richard Parnell||03-05-2001||06:04 PM||||On my V8 I can get at the plugs easily from underneath on the firewall side.  There's a lot of room.  ||||reg||12
Z||000002||V8Fiero||03-05-2001||06:36 PM||||Easy as pie. Can reach from the back plugs (closest to the trunk) from the top, and the front plugs can be reached from underneath. Plenty of room.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Scott||||reg||1
